{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/c902fc7a484246559f1df585badf82dd.poster.avif?t=1768738003\" width=1118 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/c902fc7a484246559f1df585badf82dd.webm?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/c902fc7a484246559f1df585badf82dd.mp4?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd80\ud83c\udfb8\ud83c\udfb5</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Build Cute Crabby Band (</strong>Customized\u00a0Live Music &amp; Unique Abilities)<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your crab musicians from Rock, Jazz, Funk, Traditional Chinese, Orchestral, and Electronic Synth \u2014 Whether it\u2019s Erhu with a DJ or Drums with a Saxophone \u2014 it\u2019s all up to you! Every mix creates a one-of-a-kind real-time soundtrack. From Martial Arts Bands to High-Tech Hackers to Adorable Idol Crabs, discover countless unique bands, each with their own abilities and styles. <strong>Build your band and your playstyle \u2014 all at once!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/4459b27c400f58ce1d2e5e39973d98e2.poster.avif?t=1768738003\" width=950 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/4459b27c400f58ce1d2e5e39973d98e2.webm?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/4459b27c400f58ce1d2e5e39973d98e2.mp4?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/59a7d73ae5a93b32a81195f3b49a61c9.poster.avif?t=1768738003\" width=1118 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/59a7d73ae5a93b32a81195f3b49a61c9.webm?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/59a7d73ae5a93b32a81195f3b49a61c9.mp4?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd80\ud83c\udfb8\ud83c\udfb5</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Unique Upgradable Music Weapons</strong> (Diverse Mechanics)<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the <strong>Chinese Flute Spear</strong> to the <strong>Trumpet Shotgun</strong>, the <strong>Guitar Chainsaw</strong> to the <strong>Bass Machine Gun</strong>, the <strong>Pellet Drum Taiji</strong> to the <strong>Guzheng Wind Blade</strong>, and beyond \u2014 the tech giant <i>Claw House</i> arms players with a vast arsenal of powerful, one-of-a-kind music weapons, all delivered straight to you through the <strong>Delivery Drop</strong> service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/781926f8a88efce5027f7561f726c279.poster.avif?t=1768738003\" width=950 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/781926f8a88efce5027f7561f726c279.webm?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/781926f8a88efce5027f7561f726c279.mp4?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/a9d9cad7c45f2fa39a112acb6f0b7047.poster.avif?t=1768738003\" width=950 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/a9d9cad7c45f2fa39a112acb6f0b7047.webm?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/a9d9cad7c45f2fa39a112acb6f0b7047.mp4?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/5f0dd06e9ad11e69383c3e71bb01f3f2.poster.avif?t=1768738003\" width=1118 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/5f0dd06e9ad11e69383c3e71bb01f3f2.webm?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/5f0dd06e9ad11e69383c3e71bb01f3f2.mp4?t=1768738003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd80\ud83c\udfb8\ud83c\udfb5</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Build Upgrades Anytime with Claw Chips\u00a0</strong>(Integrated Power-Ups)<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the <strong>Claw Watch</strong>, players can access the <strong>Claw Chip Store</strong> anytime to purchase unique chips and gain new abilities. Wit